        <profile name="Warriors of the Hearth" id="bcd3-995f-748b-539d" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)">
          <attributes>
            <attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Orange</attribute>
            <attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Movement</attribute>
            <attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa"/>
          </attributes>
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Once Per Turn (Army), Your Charge Phase</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">If this unit is not in combat and has not used a **^^Run^^** or **^^Retreat^^** ability this turn, make a charge roll of 2D6. While this unit has any grudge marks, you can re-roll that charge roll.</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">This unit can move a distance up to the value of the charge roll. It can move through the combat ranges of enemy units, pass across enemy models and must end that move within ½&quot; of a visible enemy unit. If it does so, it has charged.
Then, if this unit charged this turn, pick an enemy unit it passed across this turn. Inflict D3 mortal damage on that enemy unit.</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f">**^^Core^^**, **^^Move^^**, **^^Charge^^**</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"/>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
