            <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick a visible friendly **^^Grimmdron Infantry^^** unit wholly within 12&quot; of this unit to be the target. Then, make a Masterflame rune roll by rolling a dice.</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">On a 1, or if the roll is equal to or less than the number of friendly **^^Khazalite Holds^^** units that have been destroyed during the battle, pick 1 of the following effects to apply until the start of your next turn:
**Grimnir&apos;s Grit:** The target has **^^Ward (5+)^^**.
**Grimnir&apos;s Resolve:** You can re-roll charge rolls for the target.
**Grimnir&apos;s Vengeance:** Add 1 to the Damage characteristic of the target&apos;s melee weapons.</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"/>
            <characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"/>
          </characteristics>
