            <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb"/>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Pick a visible friendly **^^Grimmdron Infantry^^** unit that is wholly within 6&quot; of this unit, is not in combat and has not been set up this turn to be the target. Remove the target from the battlefield. After this unit ends its move, you must set up the target wholly within 6&quot; of this unit and not in combat. Unless this unit has any grudge marks, the target cannot use **^^Charge^^** abilities for the rest of the turn.</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"/>
