            <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick an enemy unit in combat with this unit to be the target.</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Roll a dice. On a 3+, roll a dice for each model in the target unit. For each 5+, inflict 1 mortal damage on that unit.</characteristic>
