            <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick a visible friendly **^^Grimmdron^^** unit wholly within 12&quot; of this unit to be the target. If this unit has any grudge marks, pick a visible friendly **^^Khazalite Holds^^** unit wholly within 12&quot; of this unit to be the target instead.</characteristic>
