            <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick a visible friendly **Vulkyn Flameseekers** or **^^Grimmdron Monster^^** unit wholly within 12&quot; of this unit to be the target.</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Pick 1 of the following effects:
• If you picked a friendly **Vulkyn Flameseekers** unit to be the target, until the start of your next turn, ignore negative modifiers to hit rolls and wound rolls for the target&apos;s combat attacks and ignore negative modifiers to the target&apos;s control score.
• If you picked a friendly **^^Grimmdron Monster^^** unit to be the target, add 1 to hit rolls for attacks made with the target&apos;s Companion weapons until the start of your next turn.</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"/>
