            <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">If this unit contains Ashtongue, pick a visible enemy unit within 9&quot; of this unit to be the target.</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Roll a dice. On a 3+, until the start of your next turn, units (friendly and enemy), terrain features and **^^Manifestations^^** are not visible to the target while they are more than 6&quot; from it.</characteristic>
