            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">Add 1 to unbinding rolls, banishment rolls and rhythmic hammering rolls for this unit while it has any grudge marks.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Rhythmic Hammering" id="521b-7c6e-e8bb-e666" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)">
          <attributes>
            <attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Black</attribute>
            <attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Special</attribute>
            <attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa"/>
          </attributes>
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">You declared a **^^Spell^^** ability from the &apos;Reverberations of the Runes&apos; or the &apos;Resonance of the Runes&apos; for this unit</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb"/>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">If the casting roll for that spell equals or exceeds its casting value, make a rhythmic hammering roll of 2D6.
If a rhythmic hammering roll is lower than that spell&apos;s casting value, the spell fails and its effect is not resolved.
If a rhythmic hammering roll equals or exceeds that spell&apos;s casting value, increase the range of that spell by 3&quot;. You can keep making rhythmic hammering rolls for that spell until you roll lower than its casting value. The effects of this ability are cumulative.</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"/>
            <characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"/>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
