            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Pick a visible friendly **^^Kromdron Infantry^^** unit that is wholly within 6&quot; of this unit, is not in combat and has not been set up this turn to be the target. Remove the target from the battlefield. After this unit ends its move, you must set up the target wholly within 6&quot; of this unit and more than 9&quot; from all enemy units.</characteristic>
