        <profile name="Battle Damaged" id="7a09-7da1-3ddf-2577" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)">
          <attributes>
            <attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Red</attribute>
            <attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Offensive</attribute>
            <attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8"/>
          </attributes>
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"/>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">While this unit has 10 or more damage points, the Attacks characteristic of its **Karak War Council&apos;s Armoury** is 4.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Defend the High Throne!" id="4f9a-5a71-db8a-07c2" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)">
          <attributes>
            <attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Black</attribute>
            <attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Offensive</attribute>
            <attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa"/>
          </attributes>
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Start of Any Turn</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick another visible friendly **^^Khazalite Holds^^** unit wholly within 12&quot; of this unit to be the target. For each grudge mark this unit has, you can pick another eligible unit to be an additional target.</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">For the rest of the turn, the following effects apply to the targets while they are wholly within 6&quot; of this unit. Add 3&quot; to this range for each grudge mark this unit has.
• The target&apos;s melee weapons have Anti-charge (+1 Rend).
• If the target has no grudge marks, it counts as having 1 grudge mark.</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"/>
            <characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"/>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="High Kyng&apos;s War Council" id="f9e6-6ec4-f558-f944" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)">
          <attributes>
            <attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Yellow</attribute>
            <attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Control</attribute>
            <attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa"/>
          </attributes>
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Your Hero Phase</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb"/>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Pick 1 of the following effects to apply until the start of your next turn:
**Stonesmith&apos;s Disruption:** *The stonesmith causes the ground under a group of enemies to tremble violently, disrupting their cohesion.* Pick a visible enemy unit within 12&quot; of this unit to be the target. The target has a maximum control score of 1.
**Grudgebearer&apos;s Denunciation:** *The exhortations of the grudgebearer instil in the duardin a relentless drive to enact vengeance on the foe.* While they are wholly within 12&quot; of this unit, visible friendly **^^Khazalite Holds^^** units can use **^^Charge^^** abilities even if they used a **^^Retreat^^** ability in the same turn. In addition, no mortal damage is inflicted on those friendly units by **^^Retreat^^** abilities.
**Holdseeker&apos;s Guidance:** *The holdseeker reveals magically resonant areas of the battlefield to aid the efforts of those working the runes.* Add 1 to casting rolls, chanting rolls and banishment rolls for friendly **^^Khazalite Holds^^** units while they are wholly within 12&quot; of this unit.</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"/>
            <characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"/>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Stirring the High Kyng&apos;s Ire" id="cc0c-d7b6-0035-1c10" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)">
          <attributes>
            <attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Black</attribute>
            <attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Offensive</attribute>
            <attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa"/>
          </attributes>
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Start of Battle Round</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick a visible enemy **^^Hero^^** within 18&quot; of this unit that has not been picked to be the target of this ability this battle to be the target.</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Your opponent must decide whether the target will accept the accusation or reject the accusation.
If they accept the accusation, until the start of your next turn, add 1 to hit rolls for combat attacks made by friendly **^^Khazalite Holds^^** units that target that enemy unit.
If they reject the accusation, the target cannot use commands until the start of your next turn.</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"/>
            <characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"/>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Tide of Stone" id="8be3-1e86-f39c-f737" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)">
          <attributes>
            <attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Grey</attribute>
            <attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Movement</attribute>
            <attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa"/>
          </attributes>
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Once Per Turn (Army), Any Movement Phase</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb"/>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">This unit can move D6&quot; or, if it is your movement phase, it can move 2D6&quot;. It can pass through other models and the combat ranges of enemy units, but it cannot end that move in combat.
Then, pick an enemy unit that this unit passed across during that move to be the target and roll a dice. On a 3+, inflict an amount of mortal damage on the target equal to the roll.</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f">**^^Core^^**, **^^Move^^**</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"/>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
